        "action:n1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin with, the first step is Course registration."
      ],
      "justification": "Opening clause implicitly starts the process and defines the initial registration action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2",
        "guard:b1->n3",
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If an exception is needed, then a Request for the exception should be made."
      ],
      "justification": "Condition modeled as an action step, opens XOR branch, applies positive guard, and executes the request action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "action:n4",
        "label:n4->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "On the other hand, if an exception is not needed, the process can continue."
      ],
      "justification": "Models negative condition guard, continue action, transition label, and convergence point where paths rejoin."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5",
        "guard:b2->c1",
        "action:n6",
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After the exception is approved, the next step is course enrollment, followed by seminar group enrollment."
      ],
      "justification": "Approval condition modeled as action, opens decision branch, routes on approval, and captures sequential enrollment steps."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the seminar group enrollment is completed, the homework assignment can be started."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly maps to initiating the homework assignment."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After working on the homework, it should be turned in."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the homework submission step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "The homework will then be evaluated, and the process can continue."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly maps to the homework evaluation step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->n13",
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it was not the last homework, another homework assignment will be given."
      ],
      "justification": "XOR branch handles the conditional, guard captures negative condition, action models assigning new homework."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->n15",
        "action:n15"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if it was the last homework, the process can continue."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard captures positive condition, action models process continuation."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n16",
        "action:n17"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "At the same time, two additional steps should be completed: granting accreditation and announcing the date of the exam."
      ],
      "justification": "AND branch initiates parallel execution, actions capture concurrent steps, converge rejoins flow."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n19",
        "action:n20"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After signing up for the exam, it should be attended."
      ],
      "justification": "Sequential actions accurately capture exam signup and attendance."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n21"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the exam is attended, it will be evaluated."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly maps to exam evaluation."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->n23",
        "action:n23"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the exam is passed, the course is considered passed and the process can continue."
      ],
      "justification": "XOR branch handles conditional, guard routes on pass, action marks course status."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->n24",
        "action:n24"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the exam is failed, another sign-up for the exam is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard routes on fail, action models re-signup requirement."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n26"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "and the process can continue."
      ],
      "justification": "Action and structural node jointly represent the logical conclusion of the successful process path."
    }
